OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, A car bomb exploded in a busy street
OL,6, in the Afghan capital Kabul today
OL,7, killing 10 people and injuring 40.
OL,9,FThe Soviet news agency TASS said the
OL,10,Fvictims of the blast included women and
OL,11,Fchildren.
OL,13,FA car packed with explosives caused a
OL,14,Fgreat deal of damage to a commercial
OL,15,Fbuilding near the Pakistani embassy.
OL,16,F
OL,17,FAfghan guerrillas seeking the overthrow
OL,18,Fof the Soviet-backed Najibullah
OL,19,Fgovernment were blamed for the blast.
OL,20,F
OL,23,D]CFrom 11-09-88   teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
